        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is a really nice example of patterns!\r\n\r\nI have it working with this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire('mini.ai').setup({\r\n  custom_textobjects = {\r\n    S = { { '[%s%p]()%u?[%l%d]+()', '%l()%u+[%l%d]+()' } },\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot sure it covers all cases you want. Does this work for you?",
