        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> After playing around with it some more, I'm satisfied with this, so feel free to close this issue--though not sure if that newline inconsistency is to be expected or not. In any case, thanks again for an amazing set of plugins!\r\n\r\nBoth patterns explicitly say that there should be *something* before the match start (`[%s%p]` or `[%l%u]`), so match at start of line is not possible.\r\n\r\nGlad it worked out!",
